  "body": "LOT-097\n\nRefs #742 (draft: tests first, renderer and spec to follow)\nClaim: cloud/i742-sonnet\n\n**Problem.** HFR's batch 2 previews (`R443a`-`R443n`, PR #741) contradict several defaults of the LOT-097 renderer.\n\n**Cause.** Those defaults were chosen without a capture (spec \"Pending capture\" 1-9).\n\n**Change.** Work in progress: one commit of oracle tests (`BBCodeRendererBatch2OracleTests`, one per numbered fact of #742, red), then the renderer passes and the spec.\n\n**Tests.** Red at this commit; each goes green with its fact's change.\n\n### Ledger\n\nNone.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CFjMJYradZN9EHzQni)_",
